    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Rally Fellow Heroes with Inspiring Leadership</p></blockquote><p>Bannerets are paragons of valor and leadership who protect the innocent and rally fellow adventurers to the causes of justice and freedom. Many are knights serving in Cormyr, the Silver Marches, Damara, Chessenta, or other lands of Faerûn, who wander as knights errant, carrying the fight against evil beyond their kingdom's borders.</p><p>A Banneret relies on judgment, bravery, and loyalty to the code of chivalry to defeat evildoers. Alone, a Banneret is a skilled warrior; leading a band of allies, they can turn even a poorly equipped militia into a fierce war band.</p><h3>Banneret Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.aTEQLT5kmXsKMvMB]{Knightly Envoy}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.SvzwdPwCBHHSNPUO]{Group Recovery}</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.oax9dHyjwG0DxT9G]{Team Tactics}</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.aer0BOjdRdhgfEh4]{Rallying Surge}</td></tr><tr><td>15</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.yLLVk5Mq6mZE7Mb0]{Shared Resilience}</td></tr><tr><td>18</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.Um2BjyCuk26luDr4]{Inspiring Commander}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
      "chat": ""
    },
